{# Example of using CKEditor with Stimulus controller #}
<div class="mb-3">
    <label for="example-editor" class="form-label">Éditeur de texte</label>
    <textarea 
        id="example-editor" 
        class="form-control" 
        data-controller="ckeditor" 
        data-ckeditor-config="default" 
        placeholder="Tapez votre contenu ici..."></textarea>
    <div class="form-text">Utilisez l'éditeur pour formater votre texte.</div>
</div>

{# 
How to use the CKEditor Stimulus controller:

1. Add the data-controller="ckeditor" attribute to your textarea
2. Optionally specify a configuration with data-ckeditor-config="your_config_name"
3. Make sure CKEditor is loaded in your template:

   <script src="https://cdn.ckeditor.com/ckeditor5/38.0.1/classic/ckeditor.js"></script>

   It's already included in base.html.twig
#} 